### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### 2. Request S3 Presigned Upload URL
POST http://localhost:4000/api/videos/upload-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "big_buck_bunny_1080p.mp4",
  "contentType": "video/mp4",
  "title": "Big Buck Bunny HD",
  "description": "Bản hoạt hình kinh điển 1080p 60fps để kiểm thử transcoding pipeline.",
  "tier": "free"
}

### 3. Complete Upload & Trigger Transcode Pipeline
# Thay @videoId bằng videoId nhận được ở bước 2
POST http://localhost:4000/api/videos/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "PUT_VIDEO_ID_HERE"
}

### 4. List All Videos
GET http://localhost:4000/api/videos

### 5. Get Video Details by ID
# Thay @videoId bằng ID tương ứng
GET http://localhost:4000/api/videos/PUT_VIDEO_ID_HERE

### 6. Issue Playback Access Token (Free Tier)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/playback-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-demo-001",
  "tier": "free"
}

### 7. Issue Playback Access Token (Premium Tier)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/playback-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-vip-999",
  "tier": "premium"
}

### 8. Verify Playback Access
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/verify-playback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PUT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "videoId": "PUT_VIDEO_ID_HERE"
}
